+    $$ \mathbf{q} = |\mathbf{p}| - \mathbf{s} $$
+    *Note: The absolute value $|\mathbf{p}|$ is applied component-wise. This step effectively folds the space and shifts it, preparing it for the base evaluation.* [S1, unofficial]
 
